{"id":"ba1420fb67076c3b","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-order9-cauchy-complete-order.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Cauchy Complete Order","display":"df-zfc-order9-cauchy-complete-order — ZFC Order9 Cauchy Complete Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-cauchy-complete-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-cauchy-complete-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-cauchy-complete-order — ZFC Order9 Cauchy Complete Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-cauchy-complete-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-cauchy-complete-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-cauchy-complete-order — ZFC Order9 Cauchy Complete Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (ordered set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CauchyCompleteOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CauchyCompleteOrder}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}complete\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CauchyCompleteOrder}_S(L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(L,\\leq)\\land\\forall a,b\\in L^\\omega\\;\\Biggl(\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(a(n)\\leq a(n+1)\\leq b(n+1)\\leq b(n)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a(n)\\leq x\\leq b(n)\\land a(n)\\leq y\\leq b(n))\\bigr)\\to x=y\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\exists x\\in L\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a(n)\\leq x\\leq b(n))\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}complete\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CauchyCompleteOrder}_S(L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(L,\\leq)\\land\\forall a,b\\in L^\\omega\\;\\Biggl(\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(a(n)\\leq a(n+1)\\leq b(n+1)\\leq b(n)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a(n)\\leq x\\leq b(n)\\land a(n)\\leq y\\leq b(n))\\bigr)\\to x=y\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\exists x\\in L\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a(n)\\leq x\\leq b(n))\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This fixes the otherwise ambiguous term to the nested-interval convention: every nested sequence of closed order intervals with at most one common point has exactly one common point.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (ordered set, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq$ (order relation on $L$, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CauchyCompleteOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}complete\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CauchyCompleteOrder}_S(L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(L,\\leq)\\land\\forall a,b\\in L^\\omega\\;\\Biggl(\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(a(n)\\leq a(n+1)\\leq b(n+1)\\leq b(n)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a(n)\\leq x\\leq b(n)\\land a(n)\\leq y\\leq b(n))\\bigr)\\to x=y\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\exists x\\in L\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a(n)\\leq x\\leq b(n))\\Biggr)","display":true}],"bytes":1316,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2964","